  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring and Evaluation component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitor progress and assess impact in education initiatives through continuous tracking of learning outcomes and stakeholder feedback. Support evidence-based decision-making by generating actionable insights into program effectiveness, highlighting successes in student achievement and identifying areas for instructional and systemic improvement through rigorous, data-driven evaluation. Support the undertaking of a feasibility study to inform the proposed scale up of the INSPIRED programme in the Kenya-Ethiopia-Somalia cross-border corridor. It will also support any other future evaluation needs that may arise within the INSPIRED programme.</narrative>
  </description>
